🇺🇸🇷🇺🇺🇦 On Russia Wrecking Ukrainian Shipping

▪️The US-directed attacks on Russian maritime shipping has resulted in heavy Russian strikes on Ukrainian shipping as well as port infrastructure and logistical networks connecting them to the rest of Ukraine;

▪️While this has a strategic impact on the overall war in Ukraine, inhibiting arms imports as well as impacting Ukraine's economy, it is a PROXY war - thus it is simply Russia and Ukraine destroying each other as the main instigator - the US - remains unaffected;

▪️The US use of proxy war enables it to grind down both its own proxies and targeted nations in the hopes of reducing their overall economic and military power to compensate for the US' inability to match either let alone both;

▪️Until the US pays a price for its wars and proxy wars it sees no reason not to continue - no matter how badly Russia wrecks Ukraine - the US never cared about what was always a fully expendable proxy in the first place;
